# The image needs ~2 MB of this repo: the Dockerfile's seven COPY sources.
# Everything else is documentation, notebooks and git history, and sending it
# to the daemon on every build costs time and CI disk for nothing. Without
# this file the context is the whole repo.
#
# Deny everything, then re-admit exactly what Dockerfile.argus copies.
*
!skills/
!scripts/apply_sage_patch.py
!scripts/sage_magic.py
!scripts/sage_kernel_backend.py
!scripts/deeptok_pelican.py
!feder/lakehouse_api/tests/pod_preflight.py
!review_rules.md

# Re-admitting a directory re-admits its junk too.
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/.DS_Store
